      ],
      "text": "The repository is a Burmese-language tutorial book on agentic coding with Claude Code, aimed at junior/noob developers, using a mini ecommerce project as its running example."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_448a0f949b88114c5c148a342bbae10c5976fcaf6c01c6b0c4ca647435318908",
