          "line_end": 31,
          "line_start": 28,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "thixpin/agentic-coding-basic",
          "url": "https://github.com/thixpin/agentic-coding-basic/blob/e295e241a981e932c4551d8835ff4665bc4bcdcc/README.md#L28-L31"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_bfcb4d77ec2143dd2e62e1c983aea6ada52611d67a1d387395b8bd2af6e962df"
      ],
      "text": "The tutorial project 'Mya Ri Store' is a buyer flow: product list, cart, checkout form (name/phone/address), order summary, then sending a screenshot to the seller via Viber."
    },
