      ],
      "text": "A build.sh script at the repo root produces EPUB and PDF outputs (both, or either alone) into dist/, with named files agentic-coding-basic-mm.epub and .pdf."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_5292c039a5207c5dcf1fdb723ce95fd3be4b5c0f15b1f89605a30fca2d005d08",
