      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_b19646a847fabec89bb91cf566d36f636efb7674126b8dda4c5c15fcec1693da"
      ],
      "text": "On first run, build.sh creates a Python venv at build/venv, installs markdown and fonttools, embeds the Noto Sans Myanmar font, and assembles chapters into EPUB/PDF."
    },
